    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82171" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίσσ-ευμα</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίσσ-ττευμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>superfluity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				22.7.1
			</span></i> ; <i>that which remains over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλασμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					8.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>abundance</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑστέρημα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				8.14
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ περισσεύματος τῆς καρδίας τὸ
					στόμα λαλεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					12.34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίσσωμα</span>
			, <i>excrement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.108
			</span></i>, f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.962f
			</span></i>.</div>
